OL,3,GNEWSAGrandfather, 68, graduates with
OL,4,Asocial work degree
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 68-year-old grandfather from
OL,7,Fsouth-east London has graduated with a
OL,8,Ffirst-class degree in social work.
OL,10,FChris Osagbaekhoe, from Thamesmead,
OL,11,Fgained his Bachelor of Arts (BA) from
OL,12,FGoldsmiths, University of London at the
OL,13,FQueen Elizabeth II Centre in
OL,14,FWestminster, four years after starting
OL,15,Fhis studies.
OL,17,FChris, who was born and raised in
OL,18,FNigeria, had previously studied
OL,19,Fpsychology and counselling between 2013
OL,20,Fand 2015. He has four children and 12
OL,21,Fgrandchildren.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
