OL,3,GNEWSAGrandfather, 68, graduates with
OL,4,Asocial work degree
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "Part of the inspiration was
OL,7,Fto empower people to empower
OL,8,Fthemselves, and part of the motivation
OL,9,Fwas to be a voice to the voiceless `
OL,10,Fthat was my inner drive."
